B.a_h=new A.d6("A Helpful Pup","Pip is a small brown dog. He sees a red ball by the gate. Pip picks it up and trots home. His tail wags all the way. What a helpful pup!")
B.a_m=new A.d6("Garden Day","We dig small holes in the soil. We plant one seed in each hole. Then we add a little water. Soon green leaves peek out. Our garden has begun to grow.")
